{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["If I See You in My Dreams","Masuo managed to get through all of high school and college without a girlfriend. A wizened fortune teller has predicted that it is his destiny to be alone for his entire life! When Masuo sees the beautiful Nagisa, his heart is awakened for the first time. He has serious competition in the form of the flawlessly handsome Kaizuka and the amazingly ugly Kujira.\nMasuo is determined to succeed, but he is stalled by his knack for ending up in compromising situations with other women at exactly the wrong moment.\n\n\n(Source: Media Blasters, edited)"],"ja":["夢で逢えたら (1999)",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-715","ids":{"shikimori":715,"mal":715,"anilist":715,"kodik":"serial-35610"},"kodikIds":["serial-24785","serial-35610"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-24785":"2020-04-14T10:19:26Z","serial-35610":"2021-07-29T18:54:01Z"},"title":"Увидеть тебя в моих мечтах","originalTitle":"Yume de Aetara","alt":"If I See You in My Dreams If I See You in My Dreams 夢で逢えたら (1999)","description":"«Увидеть тебя в моих мечтах» — история об одном парне по имени Фугуно Масуо Фугуно (полном неудачнике во всём, что касается отношений с девушками) и двух девушках: Нагиса Сиодзаки Нагисе и Хамаока Михо Хамаока. Сюжет здесь довольно простой (и невероятно смешной), так что дальнейшие пояснения всё испортят — намёк ясен: смотрите сами!","year":1998,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Комедия","Драма","Романтика","этти"],"rating":6.41,"popularity":2274,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/715/c3364142508ce253b85805a9a0b18453.jpeg","width":660,"height":880},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/554920fc614010fb4a595796c254b45103d55ec3.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-999","dubId":"999","label":"OpenDub","language":"ru","original":f